{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-51",
  "title": "About Faires",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "About Faires"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Faires A. Sekiya is a seasoned professional in the film and television industry, known for his expertise in camera and electrical work[1][4]. With a career spanning over two decades, Sekiya has honed his skills in various aspects of cinematography[5]."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Sekiya is particularly recognized for his work as a Steadicam operator, a role he has performed on the popular television series \"Chicago Med\"[2][3]. His talents extend beyond Steadicam operation, as he is also credited as a camera operator, director of photography, helicopter camera operator, \"B\" camera operator, and second assistant camera[6]."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Some of the notable projects in Sekiya's filmography include:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Chi-Raq\" (2015)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Chicago Med\" (2015)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Boss\" (2011)[1][4]"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Sekiya's expertise is well-regarded in the industry, having been certified by the Master Cinematographers program, which is sponsored by renowned companies Kodak and Panavision[5]. This certification underscores his technical proficiency and artistic vision in the field of cinematography."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Throughout his career, Sekiya has worked on various types of productions, including motion pictures such as \"New in Town\" (2009), where he collaborated with director Jonas Elmer and cinematographer Chris Seager[7]. His versatility and skill set have made him a valuable asset in both film and television productions."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This project is a collaboration between Acme Corp and Faires A. Sekiya to create a modern, visually engaging portfolio website for an experienced cinematographer. The project will involve an initial discovery phase to gather creative assets and establish strategic direction, followed by a 5–7 week design and development phase aimed at delivering a polished, user-friendly web presence."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Post-launch, we will provide optional social media management and ongoing support to enhance visibility, drive engagement, and bolster search engine rankings."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "By combining high-quality visuals, industry-specific SEO best practices, and a user-centric design, this engagement aims to highlight the client’s extensive experience and unique skill set in the competitive film industry."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This project is divided into three core phases—Discovery, Development, and Ongoing Support. Each phase is designed to ensure we meet your goals efficiently while maintaining flexibility for creative exploration and refinement."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Regular check-ins will be scheduled at the end of each phase to demo progress, gather feedback, and outline next steps."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Phase 1: Discovery"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "During the Discovery phase, we’ll focus on gathering essential assets, aligning on creative direction, and finalizing project logistics. Each step is designed to seamlessly transition into the Development phase, ensuring clarity and creative alignment before building begins."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Projected completion timeframes are provided for each step, with a single target deadline to complete the phase by January 17."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This phase is broken into six key steps:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Initial consult"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Domain & hosting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Asset collection"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. Brand voice"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Creative strategy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. Template selection"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Phase 2: Development"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In the Development phase, we bring the project to life by transforming ideas and designs into a fully functional website. This phase focuses on creating a seamless user experience while maintaining a strong visual identity. Each step, from architecture to deployment, ensures the site is built to align with your goals, engage your audience, and perform flawlessly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This phase is broken into six key steps:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Architecture"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Hi-Fi Mockups"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Frontend Build"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. A/B Design Review"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. QA & Launch Prep"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. Deployment & Testing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Development phase is set to run from January 20 – February 24, with each step carefully aligned to meet our timeline for a successful launch."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Phase 3: Ongoing Support & Maintenance"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Ongoing Support phase is designed to ensure your digital presence remains dynamic, optimized, and reflective of your evolving brand. This phase is structured as an optional retainer, offering flexibility and continuity for long-term success."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Whether it’s refining website performance, updating content, or integrating new features, our goal is to provide seamless support that keeps your platform fresh and aligned with your vision."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This phase covers a wide range of services, including:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Performance Monitoring"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-43",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Content Updates"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-44",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Visual Enhancements"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Feature Integration"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "SEO Optimization"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Analytics & Reporting"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "With Ongoing Support, your platform remains a powerful tool for growth, adaptation, and engagement."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The client is on an ongoing monthly retainer that they can cancel anytime. As long as it’s active, the client can essentially requests as much work product as they want."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}